{
  "meta": {
    "image_key_path": ["1", "inputs", "image"],
    "min_width": 1080,
    "min_height": 1920,
    "_note": [
      "ComfyUI API-format workflow used by the hybrid pipeline to upscale",
      "lower-resolution API-generated images (e.g. 576x1024 from Flux Pro).",
      "",
      "The pipeline:",
      "  1. Uploads the raw API image via /upload/image.",
      "  2. Injects the uploaded filename into node 1 (LoadImage).",
      "  3. Runs 4x-UltraSharp: e.g. 576x1024 -> 2304x4096.",
      "  4. Retrieves and verifies the upscaled PNG (~2304x4096 from 576x1024 input).",
      "Final MP4 is still 1080x1920: FFmpeg scales clause images to SHORTS_VIDEO_*.",
      "",
      "Required file:",
      "  models/upscale_models/ -> 4x-UltraSharp.pth",
      "",
      "This workflow is separate from the generation workflow.",
      "Set SHORTS_COMFY_UPSCALE_WORKFLOW_NAME=upscale_4x_ultrasharp in .env."
    ]
  },
  "prompt": {
    "1": {
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "placeholder.png"
      },
      "_meta": {"title": "LOAD INPUT IMAGE"}
    },
    "2": {
      "class_type": "UpscaleModelLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "model_name": "4x-UltraSharp.pth"
      },
      "_meta": {"title": "Load 4x-UltraSharp"}
    },
    "3": {
      "class_type": "ImageUpscaleWithModel",
      "inputs": {
        "upscale_model": ["2", 0],
        "image": ["1", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {"title": "4x UltraSharp Upscale"}
    },
    "4": {
      "class_type": "SaveImage",
      "inputs": {
        "images": ["3", 0],
        "filename_prefix": "upscaled_api"
      },
      "_meta": {"title": "SAVE UPSCALED"}
    }
  }
}
